      <shape android:shape="oval">
          <solid android:color="@androidprv:color/materialColorSurfaceContainerHighest"/>
      </shape>

  The oval/circle is the most un-Metro cue in the power menu (tokens:
  metrics.corner_radius_dp 0, color.neutrals.surface_off #1F1F1F).  The icon
  itself is tinted by global_actions_grid_item_lite.xml:33, not here.
-->
